name xbmks
category Package
revision 53448
shortdesc Create a cross-document bookmark tree
longdesc The package defines the concept of a document bundle, which is
longdesc a collection of documents that are to be built separately, but
longdesc have a common bookmark tree. The only options are driver
longdesc options, these are dvips (Acrobat Distiller or ps2pdf these can
longdesc be used as the PDF creator), pdfLaTeX (and LuaLaTeX, which is
longdesc treated the same as pdfLaTeX), and XeLaTeX. The package
longdesc auto-detects pdfLaTeX and XeLaTeX, and dvips is the default, so
longdesc there is actually no need to pass the driver option.
